<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Application for Certificate of Eligibility</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .header-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .logo-area {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .logo-text {
            font-size: 14pt;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .contact-info {
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }
        .title-section {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
        .title-section h1 {
            font-size: 24pt;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: normal;
        }
        .title-section h2 {
            font-size: 20pt;
            margin-top: 0;
            font-weight: normal;
        }
        .image-placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 350px;
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #888;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .contact-details {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 10pt;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
        .section-header {
            font-size: 14pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .form-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .form-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .form-group label {
            font-size: 10pt;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }
        .form-group input[type="text"], .form-group input[type="date"], .form-group select {
            border: 1px solid #aaa;
            padding: 5px;
            font-size: 10pt;
            width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .full-width-field {
            grid-column: 1 / span 2;
        }
        .signature-block {
            margin-top: 60px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }
        .signature-line {
            width: 40%;
            border-top: 1px solid black;
            padding-top: 5px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }
        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #aaa;
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        th {
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
        }
        .text-center {
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div class="header-info">
        <div class="logo-area">
            <div class="logo-text">The City College of New York</div>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-info">
            Division of Student Affairs<br>
            International Student and Scholar Services NAC 1/107<br>
            160 Convent Avenue New York, NY 10031 (212) 650-8106
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="title-section">
        <h1>The Application for the Certificate of Eligibility</h1>
        <h2>(SEVIS Form I-20)</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="image-placeholder">
        [Placeholder for Institutional Seal/Image]
    </div>

    <div class="contact-details">
        <div>
            <p>Maribel Morua, Director</p>
            <p>OISSS@ccny.cuny.edu</p>
            <p>Phone: 212-650-8106</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p>Alan Sabal,</p>
            <p>Senior Associate Director of Admissions</p>
            <p>Phone: 212-650-6444</p>
            <p>Email: asabal@ccny.cuny.edu</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="section-header">Instructions</div>
    <p>Please follow the steps below in order to ensure an accurate and speedy process.</p>

    <ol>
        <li>Apply and be accepted to the City College of New York. You will receive notice of your acceptance via email. Print a copy of your acceptance letter for your records.</li>
        <li>Secure sponsors or funding. In order to receive your I-20 you must provide evidence that you can cover all expenses related to the first full year of tuition, fees and living expenses. If you are unable to cover the costs on your own, you must identify a sponsor. A sponsor is someone who is willing to pay for your expenses, either in part or in whole. You could have more than one and your parents are considered sponsors. You may also be receiving a scholarship or a grant from your home country. This can be used as funding for your expenses.</li>
        <li>Read and complete the Application for the Certificate of Eligibility (Form I-20).</li>
        <li>Complete the Affidavit of Support (Page 3 of Application) each sponsor will need to fill out and sign a separate affidavit of support before issuing your I-20.</li>
        <li>Provide Evidence of Support (Financial Documents): As a reminder, the available funds must be enough to cover at least the first full academic year. All documents must be originals. Copies will not be accepted.</li>
    </ol>

    <div class="section-header">Sponsor Supporting Evidence</div>
    <p>A sponsor must show sufficient income and/or financial resources to assure that the student being sponsored will not become a public charge (receive Federal or State low income benefits or services) while in the United States. Applicable evidence of the sponsor's situation, as determined by the accepting school, official school, should consist of copies of any or all of the following documentation listed below. Failure to provide evidence of sufficient income and/or financial resources may result in the denial from the CUNY campus of the student's I-20. Additionally, such failure to provide similar documentation to the Consular Officer may result in denial of an F-1 Visa application.</p>

    <div class="section-header">Sponsor Must Submit Evidence of Income and Resources, as Appropriate:</div>
    <ol>
        <li><span data-field="sponsor_income_evidence_1">{{ sponsor_income_evidence_1 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="sponsor_income_evidence_2">{{ sponsor_income_evidence_2 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="sponsor_income_evidence_3">{{ sponsor_income_evidence_3 }}</span></li>
        <li>Statement of your employer on business stationery showing:
            <ol>
                <li><span data-field="sponsor_employment_date">{{ sponsor_employment_date }}</span> and nature of employment</li>
            </ol>
        </li>
        <li>Whether the position is temporary or permanent</li>
        <li>If self-employed:
            <ol>
                <li>Copy of last income tax return filed, or</li>
                <li>Report of commercial rating concern</li>
                <li>Schedule of assets with supporting documents</li>
            </ol>
        </li>
    </ol>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="section-header">Student Information</div>
    <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="name">1. Name:</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" value="{{ full_name }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="sex">2. Sex (check one):</label>
            <select id="sex">
                <option value="Male">Male</option>
                <option value="Female">Female</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group full-width-field">
            <label for="mailing_address">3. Present Mailing Address:</label>
            <input type="text" id="mailing_address" value="{{ mailing_address }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="phone">4. Telephone Number:</label>
            <input type="text" id="phone" value="{{ phone_number }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="fax">5. Fax Number:</label>
            <input type="text" id="fax" value="{{ fax_number }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="email">6. Email:</label>
            <input type="text" id="email" value="{{ email_address }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="dob">7. Date of Birth:</label>
            <input type="text" id="dob" value="{{ date_of_birth }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="place_of_birth">8. Place of Birth:</label>
            <input type="text" id="place_of_birth" value="{{ place_of_birth }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="country_of_citizenship">9. Country (or Countries) of Citizenship:</label>
            <input type="text" id="country_of_citizenship" value="{{ country_of_citizenship }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="residence_country">10. Country of Residence:</label>
            <input type="text" id="residence_country" value="{{ residence_country }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group full-width-field">
            <label for="overseas_address">11. Permanent Overseas Address:</label>
            <input type="text" id="overseas_address" value="{{ permanent_overseas_address }}">
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header">Academic Information</div>
    <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="expected_year">13. Expected Year of First Enrollment:</label>
            <input type="text" id="expected_year" value="{{ expected_year }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="academic_major">15. Expected Academic Major:</label>
            <input type="text" id="academic_major" value="{{ academic_major }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="enrollment_check_1">14. Degree Program:</label>
            <select id="enrollment_check_1">
                <option value="Bachelor's">Bachelor's</option>
                <option value="Master's">Master's</option>
                <option value="Ph.D.">Ph.D.</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="enrollment_check_2">16. Expected Semester of First Enrollment:</label>
            <select id="enrollment_check_2">
                <option value="Fall">Fall</option>
                <option value="Winter">Winter</option>
                <option value="Spring">Spring</option>
                <option value="Summer">Summer</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group full-width-field">
            <label for="us_institution_check">17. Are you currently studying at a US institution or college?</label>
            <select id="us_institution_check">
                <option value="Yes">Yes</option>
                <option value="No">No</option>
            </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group full-width-field">
            <label for="us_college_check">18. Do you currently hold an F-1 Status?</label>
            <select id="us_college_check">
                <option value="Yes">Yes</option>
                <option value="No">No</option>
            </select>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header">Questions Through 19 Through 28 to Be Completed by Applicants Already in the U.S.</div>
    <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="i94_number">19. I have an I-94 Admission Number?</label>
            <input type="text" id="i94_number" value="{{ i94_admission_number }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="sevis_id">20. What is your I-94 Admission Number?</label>
            <input type="text" id="sevis_id" value="{{ sevis_id }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group full-width-field">
            <label for="current_school_name">21. Current U.S. School Name:</label>
            <input type="text" id="current_school_name" value="{{ current_us_school_name }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group full-width-field">
            <label for="current_school_address">22. Current U.S. School Address:</label>
            <input type="text" id="current_school_address" value="{{ current_us_school_address }}">
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header">Immigration Status Questions</div>
    <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="f1_status_check">23. If you entered US without F-1 status, then what is your immigration status?</label>
            <input type="text" id="f1_status_check" value="{{ immigration_status }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="i94_expiration">24. What is the I-94 Admission #?</label>
            <input type="text" id="i94_expiration" value="{{ i94_admission_number_expiration }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group full-width-field">
            <label for="f1_status_check_2">25. If your status is not currently F-1, check one answer below:</label>
            <select id="f1_status_check_2">
                <option value="I-1">I-1 will apply to USCIS for a Change of Non-Immigrant status</option>
                <option value="I-2">I-2 will leave U.S. and re-enter with I-20 before classes begin</option>
            </select>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="section-header">Declaration & Certification of Finances</div>
    <p>Please indicate the source and amount of your financial support for the first four years of study for bachelor's degree candidates and two years for associate's degree candidates. The CUNY College that has admitted you requires documentation of guaranteed support for the first year and projected support for future years. Note that costs may vary $70-100% annually. Total amounts must meet or exceed the estimate of expenses (see "Sponsor Supporting Evidence" page).</p>
    <p>U.S. immigration authorities require colleges to receive satisfactory financial certifications from prospective students before issuing a Form I-20. Therefore, you must attach original documents for each source of financial support you indicate. Please refer to the "Sponsor Supporting Evidence" page for a list of acceptable supporting documents. Be sure to have an additional set of original documents for your appointment at the U.S. Consulate (or Embassy) overseas. Complete and send in this page with your application. Provide as much detail as possible.</p>

    <div class="section-header">SOURCES OF FINANCIAL SUPPORT</div>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>A. STUDENT</th>
                <th>Guaranteed Support 1st Year</th>
                <th>Projected Support 2nd Year</th>
                <th>Projected Support 3rd Year</th>
                <th>Projected Support 4th Year</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>Name: <span data-field="student_name_financial">{{ student_name_financial }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="student_guaranteed_1">{{ student_guaranteed_1 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="student_projected_2">{{ student_projected_2 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="student_projected_3">{{ student_projected_3 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="student_projected_4">{{ student_projected_4 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="section-header">B. PARENTS, AND/OR OTHER INDIVIDUAL SPONSORS</div>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Name</th>
                <th>Relationship to student</th>
                <th>Guaranteed Support 1st Year</th>
                <th>Projected Support 2nd Year</th>
                <th>Projected Support 3rd Year</th>
                <th>Projected Support 4th Year</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for i in range(3) %}
            <tr>
                <td>Name: <span data-field="sponsor_name_b_{{ i }}">{{ sponsors[i].name }}</span></td>
                <td>Relationship to student: <span data-field="sponsor_relationship_b_{{ i }}">{{ sponsors[i].relationship }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="sponsor_guaranteed_b_{{ i }}">{{ sponsors[i].guaranteed_1 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="sponsor_projected_b_{{ i }}">{{ sponsors[i].projected_2 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="sponsor_projected_b_{{ i }}">{{ sponsors[i].projected_3 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="sponsor_projected_b_{{ i }}">{{ sponsors[i].projected_4 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="section-header">C. GOVERNMENT, UNIVERSITY, OR OTHER SPONSOR</div>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Source</th>
                <th>Guaranteed Support 1st Year</th>
                <th>Projected Support 2nd Year</th>
                <th>Projected Support 3rd Year</th>
                <th>Projected Support 4th Year</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for i in range(3) %}
            <tr>
                <td>Source: <span data-field="govt_source_name_{{ i }}">{{ govt_sources[i].name }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="govt_guaranteed_{{ i }}">{{ govt_sources[i].guaranteed_1 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="govt_projected_{{ i }}">{{ govt_sources[i].projected_2 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="govt_projected_{{ i }}">{{ govt_sources[i].projected_3 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="govt_projected_{{ i }}">{{ govt_sources[i].projected_4 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <p>Grand Totals: $ <span data-field="grand_total_guaranteed">{{ grand_total_guaranteed }}</span> (Each total must equal the estimate of expenses for one year.)</p>
    </div>

    <p>THE COLLEGE CANNOT ISSUE A FORM I-20 UNTIL YOU MEET ALL REQUIREMENTS FOR FINANCIAL DOCUMENTATION.</p>
    <p>By signing my name to this form, I certify that the information above is a correct statement of my arrangements for financing my studies at The City College of New York.</p>
    <div class="signature-block">
        <div class="signature-line">
            (Student's signature)
        </div>
        <div class="signature-line">
            (Date)
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="section-header">Affidavit of Support</div>
    <p>This form is for individuals using their own income and/or savings to support a student. It must be completed by the person who will provide the student with full or partial financial support and/or board and room during the student's course of study at The City College of New York.</p>
    <p>Sponsors providing financial support must complete items 1-18 AND sign at item #21. Sponsors providing both financial support AND room and board must complete this entire page, items #1 through #21.</p>

    <div class="section-header">SPONSOR INFORMATION</div>
    <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="sponsor_name">1. Name of Sponsor:</label>
            <input type="text" id="sponsor_name" value="{{ sponsor_full_name }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="citizen_country">2. Citizen of (Country or Countries):</label>
            <input type="text" id="citizen_country" value="{{ sponsor_citizenship }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group full-width-field">
            <label for="address">3. Address:</label>
            <input type="text" id="address" value="{{ sponsor_address }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="employment_status">4. I am employed with (Name of employer and Street):</label>
            <input type="text" id="employment_status" value="{{ sponsor_employer_name }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="city_state_zip">5. Located at (City/State/Zip):</label>
            <input type="text" id="city_state_zip" value="{{ sponsor_city_state_zip }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="phone">6. I receive an annual income of $:</label>
            <input type="text" id="phone" value="{{ sponsor_annual_income }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group full-width-field">
            <label for="attach_statement">7. Attach a current salary confirmation statement written by that employer, or verification of annual income for self-employed or retired individuals. The employer statement or verification of annual income must be written in English or come with a certified translation.</label>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="bank_name">9. Address of Bank:</label>
            <input type="text" id="bank_name" value="{{ bank_name }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group full-width-field">
            <label for="bank_statement">8. Attach bank officer's statement of account history.</label>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header">Student Support Information</div>
    <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="student_name_affidavit">14. Name of Student:</label>
            <input type="text" id="student_name_affidavit" value="{{ student_full_name }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="student_dob_affidavit">15. Who was born on:</label>
            <input type="text" id="student_dob_affidavit" value="{{ student_date_of_birth }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="student_sex_affidavit">S/he is my:</label>
            <input type="text" id="student_sex_affidavit" value="{{ student_sex }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group full-width-field">
            <label for="relationship_to_student">16. Relationship to Student:</label>
            <input type="text" id="relationship_to_student" value="{{ relationship_to_student }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group full-width-field">
            <label for="support_statement">I hereby certify that I am willing, able, and do commit to provide <span data-field="support_commitment_amount">{{ support_commitment_amount }}</span> with the annual amount of <span data-field="support_commitment_amount_2">{{ support_commitment_amount_2 }}</span> for his/her tuition, fees, and/or living expenses each year during the entire program of study at The City University of New York until <span data-field="support_end_date">{{ support_end_date }}</span>.</label>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header">Room and Board Support Information</div>
    <p>To be completed if student will live in the sponsor's home in the U.S.</p>
    <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="room_board_check">20. I hereby certify that I will provide:</label>
            <select id="room_board_check">
                <option value="Room only">Room only in my home at the address indicated above</option>
                <option value="Full board">Full room and board in my home as indicated above during each year that s/he follows a program of study at CUNY. Note that this value cannot be included in any amount of support being provided in #18, above.</option>
            </select>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p>By signing my name to this affidavit, I certify that the information above is a correct statement of my agreement to sponsor the student herein named.</p>
    <div class="signature-block">
        <div class="signature-line">
            Sponsor Signature:
        </div>
        <div class="signature-line">
            Date:
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="section-header">Estimate of Expenses for International Students Attending The City University of New York</div>
    <p><strong>Total First Year Expenses</strong></p>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Program</th>
                <th>Tuition/Fees and Living Expenses</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>Bachelor's (undergraduate) Students</td>
                <td>Tuition/fees and living expenses = $ <span data-field="bachelors_total_first_year">{{ bachelors_total_first_year }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Graduate students in Architecture (15 credits)</td>
                <td>Tuition/fees and living expenses = $ <span data-field="grad_arch_total_first_year">{{ grad_arch_total_first_year }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Graduate students in Architecture (16 credits)</td>
                <td>Tuition/fees and living expenses = $ <span data-field="grad_arch_16_total_first_year">{{ grad_arch_16_total_first_year }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Graduate students in Engineering</td>
                <td>Tuition/fees and living expenses = $ <span data-field="grad_eng_total_first_year">{{ grad_eng_total_first_year }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Graduate students in Liberal Arts/Education</td>
                <td>Tuition/fees and living expenses = $ <span data-field="grad_lae_total_first_year">{{ grad_lae_total_first_year }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Graduate students in Professional Studies</td>
                <td>Tuition/fees and living expenses = $ <span data-field="grad_prof_total_first_year">{{ grad_prof_total_first_year }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Ph.D. Level 1</td>
                <td>Tuition/fees and living expenses = $ <span data-field="phd_level1_total_first_year">{{ phd_level1_total_first_year }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="section-header">Tuition and Fees</div>
    <p><strong>Bachelor's (undergraduate) Students</strong></p>
    <p>Undergraduate tuition/fees per academic year, two semesters: Four-Year College = $ <span data-field="bachelors_tuition_fee_total">{{ bachelors_tuition_fee_total }}</span>. Per semester, this is the minimum number of credits required to be a full-time undergraduate student (necessary to maintain lawful immigration status). If you take more than 12 credits, you will be charged at the rate of $ <span data-field="bachelors_overload_rate">{{ bachelors_overload_rate }}</span> per credit (four year colleges).</p>

    <p><strong>Masters (graduate) Students:</strong> total cost includes fees</p>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Program</th>
                <th>Guaranteed 1st Year</th>
                <th>Guaranteed 2nd Year</th>
                <th>Projected 3rd Year</th>
                <th>Projected 4th Year</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>Architecture (70 per credit)</td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_arch_guaranteed_1">{{ master_arch_guaranteed_1 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_arch_guaranteed_2">{{ master_arch_guaranteed_2 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_arch_projected_3">{{ master_arch_projected_3 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_arch_projected_4">{{ master_arch_projected_4 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Architecture (870 per credit)</td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_arch_870_guaranteed_1">{{ master_arch_870_guaranteed_1 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_arch_870_guaranteed_2">{{ master_arch_870_guaranteed_2 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_arch_870_projected_3">{{ master_arch_870_projected_3 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_arch_870_projected_4">{{ master_arch_870_projected_4 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Liberal Arts/Education (870 per credit)</td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_lae_guaranteed_1">{{ master_lae_guaranteed_1 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_lae_guaranteed_2">{{ master_lae_guaranteed_2 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_lae_projected_3">{{ master_lae_projected_3 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_lae_projected_4">{{ master_lae_projected_4 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Professional Studies (805 per credit)</td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_prof_guaranteed_1">{{ master_prof_guaranteed_1 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_prof_guaranteed_2">{{ master_prof_guaranteed_2 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_prof_projected_3">{{ master_prof_projected_3 }}</span></td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="master_prof_projected_4">{{ master_prof_projected_4 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="section-header">Student Living Expenses</div>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Item</th>
                <th>Amount</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>Books and Supplies</td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="living_books_supplies">{{ living_books_supplies }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Transportation</td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="living_transportation">{{ living_transportation }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Personal Expenses</td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="living_personal_expenses">{{ living_personal_expenses }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Meals (at home)</td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="living_meals_at_home">{{ living_meals_at_home }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Meals (away from home)</td>
                <td>$ <span data-field="living_meals_away_from_home">{{ living_meals_away_from_home }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>Total Living Expenses for one year = $ <span data-field="total_living_expenses">{{ total_living_expenses }}</span></p>

    <div class="section-header">Accompanying the Student</div>
    <p>In addition to the amount the student must certify for his/her own financial support, additional funds for each dependent must be shown. Add $ <span data-field="dependent_additional_funds">{{ dependent_additional_funds }}</span> for each adult (spouse) and $ <span data-field="dependent_additional_funds_child">{{ dependent_additional_funds_child }}</span> for each child, which will accompany the student to the U.S. This amount is for one year of expenses. Student's financial certification must show the total amount of student's tuition/fees, living expenses AND the living expenses for the dependents.</p>
    <p>Necessary items to obtain an I-20 for an accompanying dependent:</p>
    <p>Financial certification/documentation, Biographical information for each dependent, photocopy of passport biographical page, Translated marriage certificate for spouse, translated birth certificate for child.</p>
</div>

